<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>About Us - Donut House</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@300;400;600;700;800;900&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css">
</head>

<body>

    <%- include('../partials/_navbar.ejs') %>

        <!-- ABOUT HEADER -->
        <section class="aboutHeader">
            <div class="container">
                <h1>About Us</h1>

                <p>
                    Get to know Donut House, our story, our team,
                    and what makes our donuts special.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- OUR STORY -->
        <section class="infoSection" id="story">
            <div class="container">

                <div class="infoBlock">

                    <div>
                        <h2>Our Story</h2>

                        <p>
                            Our story started simple: we wanted to bring high-quality
                            donuts to the city and show people how good plant-based
                            treats can taste. Small batches, real ingredients, and
                            big flavor.
                        </p>

                        <p style="margin-top:14px;">
                            Years later, the mission is still the same — change the
                            perception of plant-based food, one donut at a time.
                        </p>

                        <p style="margin-top:14px;">
                            At Donut House we are a team of more than 170 people in
                            Bahrain and we keep growing. Our team is supported with
                            fair and transparent working conditions, ensuring every
                            member feels valued and respected.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="infoImg">
                        <img src="https://i.imgur.com/ryL66H7.jpg" alt="Donuts in tray">
                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- OUR SUPPLIERS -->
        <section class="infoSection" id="suppliers">
            <div class="container">

                <div class="infoBlock">

                    <div class="infoImg">
                        <img src="https://i.imgur.com/bnynsYm.png" alt="Chocolate dipping">
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h2>Our Suppliers</h2>

                        <p>
                            Like our donuts, our product sources are one of a kind.
                            We work closely with incredible partners who care about
                            impact, quality, and honest sourcing.
                        </p>

                        <p style="margin-top:14px;">
                            As a base for our glazes we puree whole fruits,
                            preferably sustainably sourced whenever available.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- OUR TEAM -->
        <section class="infoSection" id="team">
            <div class="container">

                <div class="infoBlock">

                    <div>
                        <h2>Our Team</h2>

                        <p>
                            In Bahrain, we are a passionate team dedicated to
                            bringing high-quality, plant-based donuts to our
                            community.
                        </p>

                        <p style="margin-top:14px;">
                            We believe in fair and transparent working conditions,
                            ensuring that every team member is valued, respected,
                            and supported as we continue to grow.
                        </p>

                        <p style="margin-top:14px;">
                            Behind every donut is a group of people who care deeply
                            about craftsmanship, sustainability, and creating
                            moments of joy — one bite at a time.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- SUSTAINABILITY -->
        <section class="infoSection" id="impact">
            <div class="container">

                <div class="infoBlock">

                    <div>
                        <h2>Sustainability</h2>

                        <p>
                            We see sustainability holistically; Every sold (or
                            donated) donut is an entry point to show people that
                            careful use of our human and planetary resources can
                            taste good. We treat people, animals, and our environment
                            fairly and with care. And by people, we don’t just mean
                            those we employ, buy from, collaborate with, and sell to
                            – we mean future generations, too!
                        </p>

                        <p style="margin-top:14px;">
                            As a self-funded, founder-owned business, we choose to
                            put our values at the front of all our decisions.
                            Success to us means we are kind AND run a profitable
                            business in a way that we hope inspires others!
                        </p>

                        <p style="margin-top:14px;">
                            We know we’re not perfect, but we question how we do
                            things and strive to do better with every donut we make.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="infoImg">
                        <img src="https://i.imgur.com/GjUgeVo.png" alt="Fresh donuts">
                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- WHAT WE BELIEVE -->
        <section class="infoSection" id="values">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="infoBlock">
                    <div>
                        <h2>What We Believe</h2>

                        <p>
                            We believe great donuts should be made with great
                            ingredients, thoughtful choices, and a little creativity.
                        </p>

                        <p style="margin-top:14px;">
                            From the ingredients we choose to the people we work with,
                            we care about quality, sustainability, and creating
                            something people genuinely enjoy.
                        </p>

                        <p style="margin-top:14px;">
                            Every donut is made to bring a little more joy to your day.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <%- include('../partials/_footer.ejs') %>

</body>

</html>